    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.32,
    "text": "Oh my god, you won't believe what I'm going to say next."
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 3.32,
    "end": 6.1,
    "text": "I believe everyone is familiar with this vibrating plate."
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 6.1,
    "end": 12.52,
    "text": "The vibrating plate, which originally cost $103, is now only $69.99."
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 12.52,
    "end": 14.16,
    "text": "This is simply crazy."
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 14.16,
    "end": 17.72,
    "text": "And just practicing for 10 minutes a day is equivalent to jogging for an hour."
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 17.72,
    "end": 21.12,
    "text": "There are also a great many action tutorials on it for you to learn."
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 21.12,
    "end": 23.16,
    "text": "And it is equipped with this pull rope for you."
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 23.16,
    "end": 24.96,
    "text": "You can also work out your arm strength."
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 24.96,
    "end": 27.26,
    "text": "It's also lightweight and easy to carry."
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 27.26,
    "end": 28.44,
    "text": "You can easily pick it up."
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 28.44,
    "end": 32.12,
    "text": "worry about its suction power either. So, having said all this, take advantage of the"
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 32.12,
    "end": 35.84,
    "text": "discount and buy it to make yourself healthier. Come on, don't miss out."
   }
